  "description": "Create a deep copy of a binary tree where each node has an additional random pointer to any node in the tree.",
  "pseudocode": "1. map = new Map()\n2. function clone(node) {\n3.   if (!node) return null\n4.   if (map.has(node)) return map.get(node)\n5.   newNode = new Node(node.val)\n6.   map.set(node, newNode)\n7.   newNode.left = clone(node.left)\n8.   newNode.right = clone(node.right)\n9.   newNode.random = clone(node.random)\n10.  return newNode\n11. }",
